Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Episode\NThe Daughter of Mephisto\NThe Demon King Appears
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it, I feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally found her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't we pretentious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.50,0:02:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to pay your taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.61,0:02:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have a single yen left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.19,0:02:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, so you refuse to pay your taxes no matter what, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You still claim you don't have a single yen even after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you take that, we'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's none of our concern!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are Duralumin's henchmen, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we are Grand Duke Duralumin's tax collection squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.44,0:03:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop taking taxes from poor people!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.35,0:03:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As if there's a prince dressed in such rags!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way a prince would be walking around alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just some crazy brat, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.21,0:03:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you're supposed to beat up is him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool, I told you to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come at me all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay these taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't pay, I'll throw you in jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Deliver the finishing blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make a fool of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are chasing me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.55,0:04:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to report everything you did to my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dinner time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive the rudeness of my men!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Return all the taxes you collected right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It is precisely because of these taxes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,that you are able to live such a splendid life, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want those kinds of taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Return them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I will do as you say, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn prince, getting so full of himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You spineless cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and collect the taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them Prince Sapphire wants a vacation home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're building a villa for the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you standing around for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and go collect those taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I have found the young girl we were looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A young girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean a prince, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Once every 2000 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,due to a mistake in Heaven, a child is born
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,a girl yet possessing the heart of a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If we extract the boy's heart from that young girl and put it into you, you will become a splendid witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:07.94,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Jigoku no kodaiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:07.94,Mephisto Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,Vastness of Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:10.60,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Washi no musume Heketo o iwattekure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:10.60,Mephisto Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,Celebrate my daughter Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:19.70,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Kaze yo, Inazuma yo, mai no uta wo utae!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:19.70,Mephisto Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,O Wind, O Lightning, sing the song of dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Hecate, you too... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.13,0:06:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.32,0:06:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa is being so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine just the way I am, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, little bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, what is the Demon King's daughter doing acting like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn a flower like that into something hideous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:55.58,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,,Safin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:55.58,Hecate Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,Surfing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.89,0:06:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who turns it into their Papa's face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, try summoning a storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:02.24,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,,Inazuma yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:02.24,Hecate Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,O Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:05.96,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,,Kaze yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:05.96,Hecate Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,O Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:09.01,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,,Mizu yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:09.01,Hecate Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,O Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it like Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to cry, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll become a great witch soon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can even get into the Magic Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:20.76,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Eraisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who splashed water on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be nice, you guys can fly through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, won't you give me a ride and fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Off we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, falling into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just flying through the sky for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't handle two people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.06,0:08:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me up higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go up higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's a pigsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry, I didn't know anyone was in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief, and after the trouble we went to building this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a pigsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.88,0:08:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like we live in a house like this because we want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because a single soldier smashed the house we used to live in to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By a soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In the first place, just because Prince Sapphire wants a villa...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,, just because he wants one, our taxes are way higher than usual...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and on top of that, they smashed our home to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Prince Sapphire's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince Sapphire is an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the idiot prince's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want a villa or anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire... Sapphire... Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That Duralumin guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how far Sapphire has gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems a demon is nearby...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, let's hurry and search for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost, lost Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.19,0:10:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrogant...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek, look at him acting so high and mighty...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm in deep trouble... What am I gonna do...?\NPlease, just keep going, Opal...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire's horse has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have business with Duralumin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His Grace is away at the moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will have them wait inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.01,0:10:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't hold back...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this place... towering up so grand and beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The prince is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing bringing strange people like that here...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That prince is becoming harder and harder to deal with...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Have him taken care of...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.77,0:10:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an assassin, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let anyone touch Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let you have your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I am no monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mephisto, the Demon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Demon King, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.76,0:11:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What business do you have with Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I transfer Sapphire's boy heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,my daughter Hecate can become a great witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, you can really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.73,0:11:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Demon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.42,0:11:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:24.62,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Aborexsi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? Just a cheap parlor trick...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say it was foolish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, how about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! H-Help... I-I get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:44.23,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Atarapusa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do you understand my power now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.16,0:11:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what happens to Sapphire if her boy's heart is taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, she'll become just an ordinary young girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean she'll become just an ordinary woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.70,0:12:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, this is more than we could have ever wished for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If the prince becomes a woman, the throne will belong to Lord Plastic...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon King, you are magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We've decided to cooperate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then bring Sapphire here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.85,0:12:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you pretend not to be home, I can tell right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.33,0:12:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if it isn't the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, right this way. We have a feast prepared for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here to be treated to a feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you destroy these people's houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, about that, I was just about to bring them their relocation compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you can't have any complaints now, can you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, right this way, the Grand Duke is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, where is the Grand Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just break into the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be the end for the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.21,0:13:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have waited a long time for this day to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What business do you have with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want that boy's heart of yours—the one that does not even fear the Demon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:34.70,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Annossah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:39.78,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Rourappirofusah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My body... won't move...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:53.70,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Amareisha Omoieis Omoishhai
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:56.20,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Arasah Poyasah
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.22,0:13:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, it went well, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When it matters most, no one is ever around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.28,0:14:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do with Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My body is going numb!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.74,0:14:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and put Sapphire down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.53,0:14:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so close, but that Demon King is so useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.12,0:14:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at what a pathetic state you're in, all over a single brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He is no ordinary brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He is an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.53,0:14:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What? He's an angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.76,0:14:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Is that really fitting for the Demon King?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.53,0:14:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your nose out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.89,0:14:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go take care of that brat yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get some water...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you're getting in the way over a single brat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go throw him away far, far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, before we get interrupted again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:33.08,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Oja, Hasha, Boinox Natsumora!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:36.90,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Griffoirano Fai-yaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.46,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Washi no sumi ka made tondeike!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.28,Mephisto Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,Fly all the way to my lair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.41,0:15:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the throne is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang there and feed the vultures!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.44,0:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No good, I can't untie it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Sapphire is okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone nasty has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasty bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:43.53,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Decorasha, Tatarabosha, Natsumora!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.90,0:16:47.22,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Amareisha, Oirus Trisshara!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:50.02,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Gakurogrishara!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:53.28,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Amareisha, Oirus Trisshara!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:55.56,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Urashoirusha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Hecate, get back on that pedestal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, now you can become a fine witch too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:21.34,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Urarasha, Namoide, Amareisha, Oirus Trisshara!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.29,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Mauling Faline!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa! A shoe fell from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone up in that tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:17:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't help them... they're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, cut over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They came to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't cross like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's cut that tree down and turn it into a bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There, now you can cross with this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't go any further than this, so good luck out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:25.37,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Uran-Bakin-Supanka, Amareisha, Dura-Dura, Amonamishara!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:33.12,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Daimao no sekaiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:33.12,Mephisto Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,World of the Great Demon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:34.84,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Jigoku no kyodaiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:34.84,Mephisto Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,Brothers of Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:40.00,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Ima koso wa, kono Hekato no kokoro wo kaeru koto wo omese shiae!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:40.00,Mephisto Spells Translation,,0,0,0,,Now, behold as I change Hecate's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There is is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.72,0:20:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.60,0:20:17.60,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,,Yakussak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You failed, didn't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, this is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something about that pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.11,0:20:47.21,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,,Pepei Jankuman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:55.94,Hecate Spells,,0,0,0,,Samanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you hide, I know right where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.38,0:21:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink... yeah, it's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:39.68,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Zuborasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.85,0:21:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a demon, aren't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!\NSapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:53.41,Mephisto Spells,,0,0,0,,Amareisha
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:22:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You horrifying monster that's grown huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.56,0:22:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, reinforcements!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in there and eat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.04,0:22:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.13,0:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm just acting out of desperation!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.58,0:22:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Crumble, mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.90,0:22:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:22:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My body suddenly stopped moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.08,0:23:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.53,0:23:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who saved us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.86,0:23:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at them over there... So Hecate saved them, didn't she!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.88,0:23:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out in front of Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.58,0:23:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.43,0:23:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.47,0:23:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,, Papa is doing all this for your own good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.24,0:23:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only doing this because I want you to get into a top-tier magic university!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.18,0:23:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand how your Papa feels?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.91,0:23:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I don't become such a fine witch, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.84,0:23:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a thing to say, good grief!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about an ungrateful child!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.11,0:23:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.74,0:23:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Today might be my loss, but I will definitely win eventually!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.90,0:23:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She really doesn't act like a witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.87,0:23:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Some witch...
